<title>USA: Reckson Associates Realty completes IPO.</title>
<headline>Reckson Associates Realty completes IPO.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckson Associates Realty Corp said  Friday that it had completed its public offering of 1,500,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The offering, which was underwritten by Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, will result in aggregate net proceeds to the company of approximately $52 million.</p>
<p>The company also said that it had closed the acquisition of Landmark Square, an 800,000-square foot office park located in Stamford, Conn. for approximately $77 million. Metropolitan Life Insurance Co provided Reckson with a $50 million first mortgage in conjunction with the transaction.</p>
</text>
